      "id": "barracks_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "Makeshift living quarters fill the ancient halls — hammocks strung between crystal pillars, cook fires blackening ceilings that once channeled light. The stench of unwashed bodies and smoked meat hangs heavy.",
